# Ollama Modelfile for the "local" preset's chat model.
#
# This does NOT define a model trained here: it re-tags Alibaba's Qwen2.5 7B
# Instruct (Apache-2.0) with a context window large enough for the agent's
# prompt plus the retrieved source chunks. Ollama's default (4096) truncates
# them, and num_ctx cannot be set over the OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
#
#   ollama pull qwen2.5:7b-instruct
#   ollama create qwen2.5-7b-16k -f agent/Modelfile
#
# The 3B variant used by the "local-3b" preset is the same with
# FROM qwen2.5:3b-instruct and the same num_ctx 16384 (note: the 3B is under the
# Qwen Research licence, non-commercial, not Apache-2.0): the agent's system prompt
# plus tool schemas alone is ~10k tokens, so an 8k context silently truncates
# every turn (measured: prompt_eval_count capped at 8191).

FROM qwen2.5:7b-instruct
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
